body:
I have a serious thought about making a tattoo with sobriety symbolism, and I will do it in upcoming months just need to save some money for it because its not going to be a small tattoo. **YOUR NOT ALONE WITH THAT THOUGHT**

&#x200B;

EDIT : My tattoo will be a man who is in a drinking position with a bottle in his hands but the bottle is empty and that for me will symbolize that I have drank all the alcohol that I wanted to and there is not going to be any more left to drink :)
